## The Cottage

::bg{location="skerry_cottage" time="day"}
@narrator: Two bunks, one stove, one table. Elias Voss's bunk is made with naval corners. The other has not been slept in for a week.
@narrator: On the table: a supper tin, lid off.
@narrator: Pinned over the stove, a photograph of a girl in an assistant keeper's cap, and on the back in pencil: "A. — first night on the light."
@inspector{mono,when="holds(implicates(supper_tin, ada))"}: Ada Pell was supposed to be ashore, sick. Her supper tin was not.
